			<backstory><![CDATA[Stabby Sharpblade’s Backstory (The Wild Goblin Monk)

Stabby Sharpblade was born into the chaotic Bloodfang Clan, a goblin tribe notorious for its fierce survivalist ways, deep within the twisted region of Bloodthorn Hollow. From an early age, Stabby stood out—not for his strength, but for his speed, cunning, and love of chaos. In a clan where might ruled, Stabby quickly learned how to outmaneuver bigger and stronger goblins, relying on his agility and unpredictability to survive.

Stabby earned his surname, Sharpblade, after winning a duel against a group of rival goblins using only a broken sword. His clan respected his fighting prowess, but Stabby’s curiosity and craving for adventure set him apart from his kin. While the Bloodfang Clan thrived on raids and conflict, Stabby sought something more exciting, something that didn’t involve the same old goblin squabbles.

During one of his wanderings, Stabby encountered Master Kaelon Windstep, a monk of the Whispering Breeze Clan. The monk's calm demeanor and graceful combat intrigued Stabby. He spent a brief time learning from Kaelon, picking up key lessons about balance, patience, and speed. Although Stabby never fully embraced the disciplined ways of the monks, he added their techniques to his own chaotic style, blending grace with his wild and unpredictable fighting.

Once his training ended, Stabby left Bloodthorn Hollow to seek bigger adventures. His travels eventually led him to Lilly Glimmergear and Ursa Catchum, two adventurers with talk of magical creatures, enchanted potatoes, and dangerous quests. With his love for chaos and thrill-seeking nature, Stabby eagerly joined their party, excited by the prospects of new adventures and the promise of causing more mischief.

Though unpredictable and sometimes difficult to read, Stabby is fiercely loyal to Lilly and Ursa, considering them his closest allies in this strange world. Now, as he journeys with them, Stabby looks for every opportunity to hone his chaotic fighting skills and embrace whatever wild adventures come their way.]]></backstory>
			<background-trinket>A small idol depicting a nightmarish creature that gives you unsettling dreams when you sleep near it</background-trinket>
			<background-traits>Chaotic and Mischievous: Stabby thrives on disorder and chaos, always seeking excitement and mischief. He loves getting into trouble and stirring things up, often acting on impulse without considering the consequences. His wild nature makes him unpredictable in most situations.</background-traits>
			<background-ideals>Freedom: Stabby believes that everyone should live life on their own terms, free from restrictions or oppressive rules. He despises authority and thrives in situations where he can do whatever he wants without consequences. “No one tells me what to do.”</background-ideals>
			<background-bonds>Lilly Glimmergear and Taurus Catchum: Despite his wild and unpredictable nature, Stabby feels a deep loyalty to Lilly and Taurus. They are the first friends he’s ever had who accepted him for who he is, and he would do anything to protect them. “They’re my crew—no one messes with them but me.”</background-bonds>
			<background-flaws>Recklessly Impulsive: Stabby often acts before thinking, jumping into dangerous situations without considering the consequences. His love for excitement can lead to unnecessary risks, putting both himself and his friends in danger. “Who needs a plan when you’ve got guts?”</background-flaws>
			<background>
				<feature name="Survivor of the Wilds:">
					<description><![CDATA[Survivor of the Wilds: Stabby can find food, shelter, and basic necessities in even the most dangerous or desolate areas, relying on his goblin instincts and years of living in Bloodthorn Hollow. He’s adept at scrounging for supplies, creating makeshift shelters, and spotting natural dangers before they strike.]]></description>
				</feature>
			</background>
			<organization>
				<name>Bloodfang Clan</name>
				<symbol>C:\Users\jhffm\OneDrive\Documents\5e Character Builder\gallery\symbols\grimfang clangrimfang clan.png</symbol>
				<allies><![CDATA[Stabby Sharpblade’s Allies:

Lilly Glimmergear – 7-year-old deep gnome artificer, Stabby's loyal companion.
Ursa Catchum – 7-year-old human druid, whose calm balances Stabby’s wild nature.
Master Kaelon Windstep – The monk who taught Stabby balance and grace.
Whispering Breeze Clan – The monk organization that remains a distant ally.
Bloodfang Clan – Stabby's goblin tribe, part of his past and potential future allies.]]></allies>
			</organization>
			<additional-features><![CDATA[Whispering Breeze Influence
Graceful Chaos: Stabby's brief training with Master Kaelon Windstep added agility and balance to his already wild combat style, blending chaos with grace.
Quick Reflexes: Stabby’s heightened agility allows him to react quickly, dodging attacks and moving fluidly in combat.]]></additional-features>
